    "body": "Ah you're totally right. We use `HasPercent` in one case (the replaced elements quirk) and `ConvertsToPercent()` in another...\r\n\r\nIt seems the `HasPercent()` call (which causes the discrepancy) was introduced all the way back to https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=585715.",
