    "created_at": "2019-12-12T21:15:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-12-12T21:15:09Z",
    "body": "> Implementing this non-quirk quirk is surprisingly(!) difficult in our new (LayoutNG) implementation.\r\n\r\nThat's certainly a good argument against special-casing `calc`. Limiting quirks is a nice goal, but not at any cost.\r\n\r\n@smfr and @emilio what is the implementation complexity in WebKit and Gecko/Servo to exclude *all* `calc()`s?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
