    "updated_at": "2020-05-06T10:18:27Z",
    "body": "The chromium issue was closed:\r\n\r\n> Marking as WontFix as FF behaviour now appears to match Blink/WebKit.\r\n\r\nhttps://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=388892#c22",
