    "created_at": "2020-05-06T10:26:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-05-06T10:26:57Z",
    "body": "I think the change would be to replace \r\n\r\n> the specified value for the height property of element is a &lt;percentage>,\r\n\r\nwith something like (cc @tabatkins )\r\n\r\n> the specified value for the height property of element is a &lt;percentage> or a [math function](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values-4/#math-function) containing a &lt;percentage> or &lt;length-percentage>\r\n\r\nHere's the relevant test: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/quirks/percentage-height-calculation.html",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
